700,000 barrels a day is planned for LAMU, a refinery meant to supply East Africa. This is Omni View Africa &amp; Middle East, Episode 6. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host. William Rudo went to the Dango Tay Plan outside Legos with Rachel Rudo. He called it a masterpiece of science, engineering, and art, and said the scale still surprised him, UA.News reports. He said Nairobi fully backs this aim of the Dango Tay Group.

