00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:05.260
The case on both sides of the Sudan Ethiopia charge is now in writing from each army.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:09.400
Yeni Shafat carries the Sudanese Armed Forces statement from late Sunday.

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:13.040
They throw out the claim that Cartoon backs Ethiopian opposition.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.460
Their first reason is non-interference.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:20.480
They say Sudan holds to international law and stays out of other countries affairs.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:24.960
They also say they will not allow a threat to sovereignty or national security.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.100
Then they turn the charge around.

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:32.440
Support for the rapid support forces, they say, is still coming off Ethiopian territory.

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:37.580
training, supplies, and military work with long-range and one-way attack drones.

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:41.860
They ask Addis Ababa to take the dispute to dialogue and official channels

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:44.000
for both countries and the region.

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:47.920
Field Marshal Birhanu Jula, Ethiopia's defense chief,

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:52.360
had accused Sudan, Egypt, and others of backing groups opposed to his government.

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:57.040
His reason is that outsiders are feeding an alliance of armed and political groups

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:00.500
and that the Tigray People's Liberation Front and Eritrea

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.740
would be a smaller threat without that help.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.880
He spoke as clashes grew again in northern Ethiopia

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:09.380
between federal forces and the TPLF and its allies.

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:12.500
Each statement treats cross-border help to fighters

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.120
as a security problem between the two capitals.

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:18.340
Neither accepts the others version of who is being helped.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.860
The step Sudan names is talks through official channels.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.520
A sign of progress is in the barrels moving.

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:27.040
Middle East crewed exports in September

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:29.780
